[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7380.31, "timestamp": "02:03:00", "text": "[笑いと息を呑む] ただ気絶させただけだよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7403.51, "timestamp": "02:03:23", "text": "ああ、神様、私の狙いはこれだ。 誰もそれを見ません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7406.95, "timestamp": "02:03:26", "text": "誰もそれを見てないよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7424.709, "timestamp": "02:03:44", "text": "今スコアはどれくらいですか？ ああ、半分だ。   わかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7426.31, "timestamp": "02:03:46", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7430.31, "timestamp": "02:03:50", "text": "えっと、爆撃機。 ああ、センチネル。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7430.629, "timestamp": "02:03:50", "text": "どこ？   なんてこった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7431.35, "timestamp": "02:03:51", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7436.79, "timestamp": "02:03:56", "text": "ああ、それが必要だったんだ。   でも、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7439.27, "timestamp": "02:03:59", "text": "あそこにも爆撃機がいるんだよ"}]